{"unit_id":"faukwaa__dsh-gap-feed#card-zh","repo":"faukwaa/dsh-gap-feed","commit":"754cb1d3bfa6282ecd40d308e9bdc7ef21dbbdf0","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-gap-feed 是面向 DSH web 的热点与提醒插件：agent 思考达到设定时长后，它会从头条、GitHub 和 Bilibili 获取内容，或选择到期提醒，并把卡片追加到当前会话流。用户可以在设置页调整开关、思考阈值、冷却时间、每小时上限和标题黑名单，也能管理提醒；对话中还可通过工具创建提醒。内容按冷却和频率限制注入，提醒保存在本机。适合希望在长时间等待时查看热点或收到提醒的 DSH web 用户。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:363-405"]}
{"unit_id":"faukwaa__dsh-gap-feed#card-en","repo":"faukwaa/dsh-gap-feed","commit":"754cb1d3bfa6282ecd40d308e9bdc7ef21dbbdf0","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-gap-feed adds Toutiao, GitHub, and Bilibili headlines or due reminders to DSH web conversations during long thinking. Configure the wait and rate limits in settings, manage reminders there, or create one through chat. Reminder data is stored locally.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:363-405"]}
