{"unit_id":"faukwaa__dsh-gap-feed#feature-1","repo":"faukwaa/dsh-gap-feed","commit":"754cb1d3bfa6282ecd40d308e9bdc7ef21dbbdf0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-gap-feed 的功能「热点内容注入」：在 agent 持续思考达到阈值且通过冷却与每小时上限检查后，插件选择未展示的新闻并追加为会话消息卡片；卡片可打开新闻链接。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:363-405"]}
{"unit_id":"faukwaa__dsh-gap-feed#feature-2","repo":"faukwaa/dsh-gap-feed","commit":"754cb1d3bfa6282ecd40d308e9bdc7ef21dbbdf0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-gap-feed 的功能「对话提醒」：对话模型可调用 gap_feed_reminder_add 工具写入提醒，支持 ISO 时间或 Unix 毫秒；到期且未完成的提醒会在后续注入时优先显示。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:105-148"]}
{"unit_id":"faukwaa__dsh-gap-feed#feature-3","repo":"faukwaa/dsh-gap-feed","commit":"754cb1d3bfa6282ecd40d308e9bdc7ef21dbbdf0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-gap-feed 的功能「设置与提醒管理」：设置页可切换插件、调整思考阈值与注入频率、编辑标题黑名单，并新增、修改、完成或删除提醒；配置变更即时应用。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/settings.ts:31-39"]}
